{"canonical_record":{"canonical_payload_sha256":"5a169ee185529b1ca4851f3be796fcc8a820b32848bd9bbcdca1e6b3b171c4d9","full_review_record_id":"fullrev_adcea616436743c628a539d537c71928487c50d0bf230b153ad5617f9d95e34b","overall_assessment":"The paper is well-organized with a logical flow from motivation to algorithm and experiments. The mathematical notation is consistent and clearly defined. The primary clarity limitation is the absence of the pseudocode referenced in the main text, which is deferred to an Appendix not included in the provided input, thereby limiting the reproducibility of the algorithm's implementation details.","paper_id":"By1snw5gl","paper_identity_sha256":"5119feefc6e72eb7fb6d21440df7f214f4908400d39f93c1534e29ee48c40a3d","prompt_identity_sha256":"2d6d8c94d894947ea73618ff8cf94ca2f05914eee47447be6a426cf6817ddf30","raw_response_sha256":"7d7f3006550682bacb28f962923df07215c3e4a0ea3afd2fddf2e5171a94a28a","request_identity_sha256":"1b6421d68eb4cbed062831e73bc4685a5ec48978d76775a4acfc26331ef1498f","reviewer_identity_sha256":"c1cd7c7fdd4a2cbeb45c2f21af982ad0f30bffae8ae148e3eba36479685cf360","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"agentreview-full-review-corpus-v4","structural_context_sha256":"829eeac5d4f7b9aae90d373379a8789d8e4139871297ca9a38d4f88f4864c0a1","subdimension_sections":[{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-016"],"review_text":"The paper is well-structured, moving logically from motivation to background, algorithm, and experiments. The writing is generally clear and concise. However, the main text states that 'Additional details are present in the pseudocode provided in the Appendix,' but this Appendix is not included in the provided input. This omission prevents a full assessment of the algorithm's step-by-step clarity and reproducibility, as the specific implementation logic for the limited-memory SR1 update is not visible in the main body.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-WRT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-009","SRC-015"],"review_text":"The mathematical notation is consistent and well-defined. Key variables such as the Hessian approximation B_k, the step s_k, and the gradient difference y_k are clearly introduced and used consistently throughout the background and algorithm sections. The derivation of the limited-memory SR1 update formula is presented with clear definitions for the component matrices S_k, Y_k, D_k, and L_k, making the mathematical exposition easy to follow.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-NOT"},{"paper_anchor_ids":["SRC-020","SRC-023"],"review_text":"The figure captions are descriptive and provide context for the visual data, such as specifying the dataset and the presence or absence of batch normalization. The text explicitly notes that y-axis scales differ between plots, which is a useful clarification for interpreting the results. However, as the visual pixels are not available, the legibility and specific visual design of the plots cannot be assessed.","subdimension_id":"CLAR-FIG"}]},"disposition":"CANONICAL_FULL_REVIEW_COMMITTED","item_commit_sha256":"39bb39e552b0aae28a3a5701eef175dfc1ad30bc282715183b039a0bde53265e","paper_id":"By1snw5gl","paper_ordinal":65,"raw_attempts":[{"assistant_content_base64":"","assistant_content_sha256":"7d7f3006550682bacb28f962923df07215c3e4a0ea3afd2fddf2e5171a94a28a","attempt_index":0,"error":"","finish_reason":"stop","paper_id":"By1snw5gl","raw_provider_response_base64":"","raw_provider_response_sha256":"300e2f959ead44033490e58d04e1b79cd7520894f3285744139dd0a97f07e620","request_identity_sha256":"1b6421d68eb4cbed062831e73bc4685a5ec48978d76775a4acfc26331ef1498f","role":"CLAR","schema_version":"no-memory-full-review-corpus-build-v5","usage":{"completion_tokens":524,"prompt_tokens":13801,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"total_tokens":14325},"valid":true}],"request_identity_sha256":"1b6421d68eb4cbed062831e73bc4685a5ec48978d76775a4acfc26331ef1498f","role":"CLAR","role_ordinal":1,"schema_version":"corpus-build-bootstrap-checkpoint-v4"}